@startuml state-listing
' Spec 003 — listing lifecycle. Must agree with REQ-003-5..11 here and with spec 004.
' Solid arrows: Employer actions, specified in spec 003.
' Dashed arrows: Admin actions, specified in spec 004 (drawn here so the picture is whole).

hide empty description
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor white
  BackgroundColor<<public>> #dcfce7
  BackgroundColor<<done>> #E8E8E8
  BorderColor #94a3b8
}

state "Draft" as Draft
state "Pending approval" as Pending
state "Published" as Published <<public>>
state "Rejected" as Rejected
state "Closed" as Closed <<done>>
state "Taken down" as TakenDown <<done>>

[*] --> Draft : employer saves\na new listing
Draft : only the employer sees it
Draft : can be edited and deleted
Draft --> Draft : edit
Draft --> Pending : submit for approval\n(complete, within the limit)
Draft --> [*] : delete

Pending : waiting for an Admin
Pending : locked — cannot be edited
Pending --> Draft : withdraw
Pending -[dashed]-> Published : Admin approves (004)
Pending -[dashed]-> Rejected : Admin rejects\nwith a reason (004)

Rejected : employer sees the reason
Rejected : can be edited and deleted
Rejected --> Rejected : edit
Rejected --> Pending : resubmit\n(complete, within the limit)
Rejected --> [*] : delete

Published : visible to everyone (005)
Published : locked — cannot be edited
Published --> Closed : employer closes
Published -[dashed]-> TakenDown : Admin takes down (004)

Closed : no longer public; kept in My listings
TakenDown : no longer public; kept in My listings

legend right
  |= Mark |= Meaning |
  | solid arrow | Employer action (this spec) |
  | dashed arrow | Admin action (spec 004) |
  | green | publicly visible |
  | grey | no Employer actions; Closed is final |
endlegend
@enduml
